const S = {"LANGS": ["de", "es", "fr", "it", "ko", "ms", "nl", "pt", "sv", "th", "vi"], "K": {"962576231": {"en": null, "plural": true, "d": "Cancel subscription flow, confirmation dialog: title of the warning block. Tells the user how many of their documents will be locked when the subscription ends. [%1$s:n] = number of documents (drives the plural form), [%1$s:end_date] = date the subscription ends, inserted already formatted. Keep both placeholders exactly as they are.", "t": {}}, "969345843": {"en": "This website is not affiliated with the CRA", "d": "Disclaimer line shown under the hero on the TD1 and T4 form pages (/td1-form, /t4-form). CRA = Canada Revenue Agency (French: Agence du revenu du Canada, ARC), Canada's federal tax authority. Canadian forms. Same pattern as the IRS, HMRC and ATO disclaimers.", "t": {"de": "Diese Webseite ist nicht mit der CRA verbunden", "es": "Esta página web no está afiliada a la CRA", "fr": "Ce site web n'est pas affilié à l'Agence du revenu du Canada (ARC)", "it": "Questo sito web non è affiliato alla CRA", "ko": "본 웹 사이트는 캐나다 국세청(CRA)과 관련이 없습니다.", "ms": "Laman web ini tidak mempunyai kaitan dengan CRA", "nl": "Deze website is niet verbonden met de CRA", "pt": "Este site não tem vínculo com a Receita do Canadá (CRA)", "sv": "Denna webbplats är inte ansluten till CRA", "th": "เว็บไซต์นี้ไม่มีความเกี่ยวข้องกับ CRA", "vi": "Trang mạng này không liên kết với Cơ quan Thuế vụ Canada (CRA)"}}, "969345847": {"en": "T4", "d": "Form name on the T4 landing page (/t4-form), inserted as the form name in the page strings, e.g. the hero title. Same as Forms::types::td1::name. T4 – Statement of Remuneration Paid (French official name: État de la rémunération payée) of the Canada Revenue Agency (CRA). Slip issued by employers showing an employee's employment income and the deductions taken during the year. \"T4\" is the official form code – keep it as is. Canadian forms.", "t": {"de": "T4", "es": "T4", "fr": "T4", "it": "T4", "ko": "T4", "ms": "T4", "nl": "T4", "pt": "T4", "sv": "T4", "th": "T4", "vi": "T4"}}, "969345848": {"en": "Fill in the Canada Revenue Agency TD1 personal tax credits return. Your employer uses it to set your tax deductions. Download a PDF.", "d": "SEO meta description (search results snippet). Recommended max ~160 characters. Not visible on the page. For the TD1 landing page (/td1-form). TD1 – Personal Tax Credits Return of the Canada Revenue Agency (CRA; French: Agence du revenu du Canada, ARC). Employees give it to their employer, who uses it to work out how much income tax to deduct from their pay. \"TD1\" is the official form code – keep it as is. Canadian forms.", "t": {"de": "Fülle die TD1-Erklärung zu persönlichen Steuergutschriften der kanadischen Steuerbehörde (CRA) aus. Dein Arbeitgeber legt damit deine Steuerabzüge fest. Lade ein PDF herunter.", "es": "Rellena la declaración TD1 de créditos fiscales personales de la Agencia de Ingresos de Canadá (CRA). Tu empleador la usa para fijar tus retenciones de impuestos. Descarga un PDF.", "fr": "Remplissez la Déclaration des crédits d'impôt personnels TD1 de l'Agence du revenu du Canada. Votre employeur l'utilise pour calculer vos retenues d'impôt. Téléchargez un PDF.", "it": "Compila la dichiarazione TD1 dei crediti d'imposta personali dell'Agenzia delle entrate canadese (CRA). Il tuo datore di lavoro la usa per stabilire le ritenute fiscali. Scarica un PDF.", "ko": "캐나다 국세청(CRA)의 TD1 개인 세액공제 신고서를 작성하세요. 고용주가 이 신고서를 바탕으로 원천징수 세액을 정합니다. PDF를 다운로드하세요.", "ms": "Isi penyata TD1 kredit cukai peribadi Agensi Hasil Kanada (CRA). Majikan anda menggunakannya untuk menetapkan potongan cukai anda. Muat turun PDF.", "nl": "Vul de TD1-aangifte voor persoonlijke belastingkredieten van de Canadese belastingdienst (CRA) in. Je werkgever gebruikt die om je belastinginhoudingen te bepalen. Download een pdf.", "pt": "Preencha a declaração de créditos fiscais pessoais TD1 da Receita do Canadá (CRA). Seu empregador a usa para definir o imposto descontado do seu salário. Baixe um PDF.", "sv": "Fyll i TD1, det kanadensiska skatteverkets (CRA) blankett för personliga skattereduktioner. Din arbetsgivare använder den för att beräkna ditt skatteavdrag. Ladda ner en PDF.", "th": "กรอกแบบแสดงรายการเครดิตภาษีส่วนบุคคล TD1 ของกรมสรรพากรแคนาดา (CRA) นายจ้างของคุณใช้แบบฟอร์มนี้เพื่อกำหนดภาษีที่หักจากเงินเดือน ดาวน์โหลด PDF", "vi": "Điền tờ khai tín dụng thuế cá nhân TD1 của Cơ quan Thuế vụ Canada (CRA). Chủ lao động dùng tờ khai này để xác định khoản thuế khấu trừ của bạn. Tải xuống tệp PDF."}}, "969345849": {"en": "Complete the 2026 CRA TD1 personal tax credits return in PDF Help and download a PDF.", "d": "Social sharing (Open Graph) description, shown when the page link is shared. Not visible on the page. For the TD1 landing page (/td1-form). TD1 – Personal Tax Credits Return of the Canada Revenue Agency (CRA; French: Agence du revenu du Canada, ARC). Employees give it to their employer, who uses it to work out how much income tax to deduct from their pay. \"TD1\" is the official form code – keep it as is. Canadian forms.", "t": {"de": "Fülle mit PDF Help die TD1-Erklärung 2026 der CRA zu persönlichen Steuergutschriften aus und lade ein PDF herunter.", "es": "Completa la declaración TD1 de créditos fiscales personales de 2026 de la CRA en PDF Help y descarga un PDF.", "fr": "Remplissez la Déclaration des crédits d'impôt personnels TD1 2026 de l'ARC avec PDF Help et téléchargez un PDF.", "it": "Compila la dichiarazione TD1 2026 dei crediti d'imposta personali della CRA con PDF Help e scarica un PDF.", "ko": "PDF Help에서 2026년 캐나다 국세청(CRA) TD1 개인 세액공제 신고서를 작성하고 PDF를 다운로드하세요.", "ms": "Lengkapkan penyata TD1 kredit cukai peribadi CRA 2026 dalam PDF Help dan muat turun PDF.", "nl": "Vul de TD1-aangifte 2026 voor persoonlijke belastingkredieten van de CRA in met PDF Help en download een pdf.", "pt": "Preencha a declaração de créditos fiscais pessoais TD1 de 2026 da CRA no PDF Help e baixe um PDF.", "sv": "Fyll i CRA:s TD1-blankett för personliga skattereduktioner 2026 med PDF Help och ladda ner en PDF.", "th": "กรอกแบบแสดงรายการเครดิตภาษีส่วนบุคคล TD1 ปี 2026 ของ CRA ใน PDF Help แล้วดาวน์โหลด PDF", "vi": "Điền tờ khai tín dụng thuế cá nhân TD1 năm 2026 của CRA trong PDF Help và tải xuống tệp PDF."}}, "969345850": {"en": "Fill In a TD1 Form Online - PDF Help", "d": "Social sharing (Open Graph) title, shown when the page link is shared. Not visible on the page. For the TD1 landing page (/td1-form). TD1 – Personal Tax Credits Return of the Canada Revenue Agency (CRA; French: Agence du revenu du Canada, ARC). Employees give it to their employer, who uses it to work out how much income tax to deduct from their pay. \"TD1\" is the official form code – keep it as is. Canadian forms.", "t": {"de": "TD1 online ausfüllen – PDF Help", "es": "Rellena un TD1 en línea - PDF Help", "fr": "Remplissez un formulaire TD1 en ligne - PDF Help", "it": "Compila un TD1 online - PDF Help", "ko": "온라인으로 TD1 작성 - PDF Help", "ms": "Isi borang TD1 dalam talian - PDF Help", "nl": "TD1 online invullen - PDF Help", "pt": "Preencha um TD1 online – PDF Help", "sv": "Fyll i en TD1 online - PDF Help", "th": "กรอกแบบฟอร์ม TD1 ออนไลน์ - PDF Help", "vi": "Điền mẫu TD1 trực tuyến - PDF Help"}}, "969345854": {"en": "Fill In a T4 Form Online - PDF Help", "d": "Social sharing (Open Graph) title, shown when the page link is shared. Not visible on the page. For the T4 landing page (/t4-form). T4 – Statement of Remuneration Paid (French official name: État de la rémunération payée) of the Canada Revenue Agency (CRA). Slip issued by employers showing an employee's employment income and the deductions taken during the year. \"T4\" is the official form code – keep it as is. Canadian forms.", "t": {"de": "T4 online ausfüllen – PDF Help", "es": "Rellena un T4 en línea - PDF Help", "fr": "Remplissez un formulaire T4 en ligne - PDF Help", "it": "Compila un T4 online - PDF Help", "ko": "온라인으로 T4 작성 - PDF Help", "ms": "Isi borang T4 dalam t